WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.257
Rest. Without watching the clock.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:09.341
Tap Made and the rest timer starts on its own. The ring counts down while you chalk up. Put the phone down.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:15.187
Need more time? Add thirty seconds. Reset it, or skip the rest when you are ready.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:18.791
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
